sk management, real notes\n- Every applicant is interviewed before enrolling. Serious learners only.\n- A 200+ learner community you stay part of after the course\n- Founded by SEBI-registered Research Analyst Prateek Goel (Reg. No. INH000026390), ex Moody’s Analytics\n\nWant to try it before you commit?\nTrader For A Day. One full day at a desk on our trading floor. ₹2,000. Book on District (link in bio).\n\nSEBI’s new study says 89% of traders under 30 lost money last year. Yahan log tips lene nahi, seekhne aate hain.\n\n Opp. Metro Pillar 126, MG Road, Ghitorni,Delhi (Yellow Line)\n Link in bio to book Trader For A Day/Offline Classes, or search “Equity Trading Hub” on Google/District.\nhttps://link.district.in/DSTRKT/nbqkeye4\nSave this for the weekend. Tag the friend who says “market samajh nahi aata”.\n\nInvestment in securities market are subject to market risks. Read all the related documents carefully before investing. Registration granted by SEBI, enlistment as RA with Exchange & certification from NISM in no way guarantee performance of the intermediary or provide any assurance of returns to investors.\n\n#delhi#stockmarketclasses #stockmarket#thingstodoindelhi#equitytradinghub learnstockmarket gurgaon","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_02965cbc5f99f03402261564e249","publishedAt":"2026-09-04T14:15:01.000Z","profileId":"prf_7507371896af363c4dc4610ce15f","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dc3myysBXb4/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":1732345,"likesCount":11467,"sharesCount":19,"commentsCount":36,"interactionsCount":11522,"engagementRatePerViews":0.6651100098421504,"engagementRatePerFollowers":2.691804504251939,"profileFollowersCount":428040,"profileFollowingCount":28,"profilePostsCount":11993,"mediaCount":1,"duration":39.965,"hashtags":["#delhi","#stockmarketclasses","#stockmarket","#thingstodoindelhi","#equitytradinghub"],"coAuthors":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"equity_trading_hub"},{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"prateek.goelofficial"}],"mentions":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"equity_trading_hub"}],"platformId":"Dc3myysBXb4","profilePlatformId":"4446325328","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/whatshotdelhi/pfp.webp","profileBio":"Whats Hot is a digital platform, part of the Times Internet group, focused on discovering the latest and most exciting things happening in Delhi NCR","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"We found this room in Gurgaon and honestly we thought it was a gaming setup. It isn't. People actually come here to learn the stock market properly, in person. Real books, real notes, no telegram tips, no shortcuts. Charts, fundamentals, risk and a room full of people learning it with you. Hi, my name is Riya Verma and I have recently completed my offline course about trading from Equity Trading Hub. Now I can proudly say I know trading. And it was a really nice experience for me as a beginner. I will go further in this field. Best mentor I ever seen.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.001,"endSeconds":4.081,"text":"We found this room in Gurgaon and honestly we thought it was a gaming setup."},{"startSeconds":4.081,"endSeconds":5.081,"text":"It isn't."},{"startSeconds":7.881,"endSeconds":12.601,"text":"People actually come here to learn the stock market properly, in person."},{"startSeconds":12.601,"endSeconds":16.521,"text":"Real books, real notes, no telegram tips, no shortcuts."},{"startSeconds":16.521,"endSeconds":24.521,"text":"Charts, fundamentals, risk and a room full of people learning it with you."},{"startSeconds":25.561,"endSeconds":29.521,"text":"Hi, my name is Riya Verma and I have r